{"seq":2,"slug":"adr-template-design","title":"ADR 模板设计与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-template-design","wordCount":1260,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"adr-模板设计与最佳实践\">ADR 模板设计与最佳实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>ADR 模板是决策记录实践能否在团队中落地的关键因素。一个过于简单的模板可能遗漏重要信息，一个过于复杂的模板则会因高摩擦而被团队放弃。从 Michael Nygard 2011 年提出的经典五段式模板，到 MADR（Markdown Architectural Decision Records）的结构化扩展，再到各种企业定制版本，业界已经积累了丰富的模板设计经验。本文将系统对比主流模板风格，并提供根据团队特征选择或定制模板的实用指南。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"nygard-经典模板\">Nygard 经典模板</h3><p>Michael Nygard 在其开创性文章中定义了 ADR 的最小化结构。这个模板以极致的简洁著称，它认为一份有效的 ADR 只需要回答三个核心问题：背景是什么、决策是什么、后果是什么。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR-NNNN: [简短决策标题]&#10;&#10;## Status&#10;&#10;[Proposed | Accepted | Deprecated | Superseded by ADR-XXXX]&#10;&#10;## Context&#10;&#10;[描述促使这个决策产生的情境。有哪些约束力在起作用？ 技术约束、业务需求、团队能力、时间压力。]&#10;&#10;## Decision&#10;&#10;[清晰明确地陈述决策。用现在时态表述。 &quot;We will use X&quot; 而非 &quot;We decided to use X&quot;。]&#10;&#10;## Consequences&#10;&#10;[决策的后果——好的和坏的。 每个决策都有代价，诚实记录权衡取舍。]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR-NNNN: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">简短决策标题</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[Proposed | Accepted | Deprecated | Superseded by ADR-XXXX]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[描述促使这个决策产生的情境。有哪些约束力在起作用？ 技术约束、业务需求、团队能力、时间压力。]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[清晰明确地陈述决策。用现在时态表述。 \"We will use X\" 而非 \"We decided to use X\"。]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Consequences</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[决策的后果——好的和坏的。 每个决策都有代价，诚实记录权衡取舍。]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个模板的核心优势是低摩擦——一份 ADR 可以在 15 分钟内完成。它特别适合：小型团队（5-15 人）、刚开始引入 ADR 实践的组织、以及需要快速记录频繁决策的敏捷环境。</p>\n<h3 id=\"madr-markdown-architectural-decision-records\">MADR（Markdown Architectural Decision Records）</h3><p>MADR 由 Oliver Kopp 等人在 Nygard 模板基础上发展而来，增加了更多结构化字段以支撑更严格的决策分析。当前最新版本为 MADR 4.0。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# [简短决策标题]&#10;&#10;## Context and Problem Statement&#10;&#10;[描述上下文和问题陈述，例如自由形式的两到三句话， 或者一个说明性的用户故事格式]&#10;&#10;## Decision Drivers&#10;&#10;- [driver 1: 例如&quot;必须支持 10K req/s，P99 &lt; 200ms&quot;]&#10;- [driver 2: 例如&quot;团队对技术 X 经验有限&quot;]&#10;- [driver 3: 例如&quot;必须在 6 周内上线&quot;]&#10;&#10;## Considered Options&#10;&#10;- [Option 1]&#10;- [Option 2]&#10;- [Option 3]&#10;&#10;## Decision Outcome&#10;&#10;Chosen option: &quot;[Option N]&quot;, because [justification].&#10;&#10;### Consequences&#10;&#10;- Good, because [positive consequence]&#10;- Bad, because [negative consequence]&#10;- Neutral, because [tradeoff with unclear impact]&#10;&#10;### Confirmation&#10;&#10;[描述如何确认决策被正确实施。 例如：代码评审标准、自动化测试、架构适应度函数]&#10;&#10;## Pros and Cons of the Options&#10;&#10;### [Option 1]&#10;&#10;[描述 | 示例 | 链接]&#10;&#10;- Good, because [argument a]&#10;- Good, because [argument b]&#10;- Bad, because [argument c]&#10;&#10;### [Option 2]&#10;&#10;[描述 | 示例 | 链接]&#10;&#10;- Good, because [argument a]&#10;- Bad, because [argument b]&#10;- Bad, because [argument c]&#10;&#10;## More Information&#10;&#10;[相关 ADR 链接、会议记录、调研文档等]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">简短决策标题</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Context and Problem Statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[描述上下文和问题陈述，例如自由形式的两到三句话， 或者一个说明性的用户故事格式]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Decision Drivers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [driver 1: 例如\"必须支持 10K req/s，P99 &#x3C; 200ms\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [driver 2: 例如\"团队对技术 X 经验有限\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [driver 3: 例如\"必须在 6 周内上线\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Considered Options</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [Option 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [Option 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [Option 3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Decision Outcome</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Chosen option: \"[Option N]\", because [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">justification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Consequences</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Good, because [positive consequence]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bad, because [negative consequence]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Neutral, because [tradeoff with unclear impact]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Confirmation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[描述如何确认决策被正确实施。 例如：代码评审标准、自动化测试、架构适应度函数]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Pros and Cons of the Options</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### [Option 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[描述 | 示例 | 链接]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Good, because [argument a]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Good, because [argument b]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bad, because [argument c]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### [Option 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[描述 | 示例 | 链接]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Good, because [argument a]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bad, because [argument b]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bad, because [argument c]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## More Information</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[相关 ADR 链接、会议记录、调研文档等]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MADR 的独特价值在于 <strong>Decision Drivers</strong>（决策驱动因素）和 <strong>Confirmation</strong>（确认机制）两个部分。前者迫使作者明确评估标准，后者确保决策不只是纸面文章而能被验证执行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"y-statement-模板\">Y-Statement 模板</h3><p>Y-Statement 是一种极简的单句式 ADR 格式，适用于需要大量快速记录的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"In the context of [situation/problem],&#10;facing [concern],&#10;we decided for [option]&#10;and against [other options],&#10;to achieve [quality goals],&#10;accepting [downsides].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>In the context of [situation/problem],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>facing [concern],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>we decided for [option]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and against [other options],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>to achieve [quality goals],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>accepting [downsides].</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实际使用示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"In the context of inter-service communication, facing the need for low-latency and type-safe APIs, we decided for gRPC with Protocol Buffers and against REST with JSON and GraphQL, to achieve sub-10ms P99 latency and compile-time type checking, accepting higher complexity in debugging and limited browser support.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">In the context of inter-service communication, facing the need for low-latency and type-safe APIs, we decided for gRPC with Protocol Buffers and against REST with JSON and GraphQL, to achieve sub-10ms P99 latency and compile-time type checking, accepting higher complexity in debugging and limited browser support.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"模板选择决策矩阵\">模板选择决策矩阵</h3><p>不同的团队环境适合不同的模板风格。以下矩阵帮助做出选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Nygard 经典</th>\n<th>MADR</th>\n<th>Y-Statement</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编写时间</td>\n<td>10-15 分钟</td>\n<td>30-45 分钟</td>\n<td>2-5 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合团队规模</td>\n<td>5-15 人</td>\n<td>15-100 人</td>\n<td>任意规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策复杂度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形式化程度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>日常架构决策</td>\n<td>跨团队重大决策</td>\n<td>快速记录大量小决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入门难度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"企业级定制模板设计\">企业级定制模板设计</h3><p>大型组织通常需要在标准模板基础上增加组织特有的字段。以下是一个综合了多家科技公司实践的企业级模板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR-[NNN]: [决策标题]&#10;&#10;| 字段             | 内容                                                     |&#10;| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |&#10;| **Status**       | Proposed / Accepted / Deprecated / Superseded by ADR-NNN |&#10;| **Date**         | YYYY-MM-DD                                               |&#10;| **Author**       | [姓名]                                                   |&#10;| **Reviewers**    | [评审人列表]                                             |&#10;| **Approver**     | [最终决策人]                                             |&#10;| **Related ADRs** | [关联决策链接]                                           |&#10;| **Confidence**   | High / Medium / Low                                      |&#10;| **Revisit By**   | [建议重新评估的日期或触发条件]                           |&#10;&#10;## Context&#10;&#10;[2-3 段描述当前情况、面临的问题、存在的约束]&#10;&#10;## Decision Drivers&#10;&#10;- [驱动因素 1]&#10;- [驱动因素 2]&#10;- [驱动因素 3]&#10;&#10;## Decision&#10;&#10;[明确、具体地陈述决策内容]&#10;&#10;## Alternatives Considered&#10;&#10;### Option A: [名称]&#10;&#10;- Pros: [优势列表]&#10;- Cons: [劣势列表]&#10;- Effort: [工作量估算]&#10;&#10;### Option B: [名称]&#10;&#10;- Pros: [优势列表]&#10;- Cons: [劣势列表]&#10;- Effort: [工作量估算]&#10;&#10;## Comparison Matrix&#10;&#10;| Criterion      | Weight | Option A | Option B | Option C |&#10;| -------------- | ------ | -------- | -------- | -------- |&#10;| Performance    | 30%    | ⭐⭐⭐   | ⭐⭐     | ⭐⭐⭐   |&#10;| Team Expertise | 25%    | ⭐⭐     | ⭐⭐⭐   | ⭐       |&#10;| Reversibility  | 20%    | ⭐⭐⭐   | ⭐⭐     | ⭐       |&#10;| Cost           | 15%    | ⭐⭐     | ⭐⭐⭐   | ⭐⭐     |&#10;| Maintenance    | 10%    | ⭐⭐     | ⭐⭐⭐   | ⭐⭐     |&#10;&#10;## Consequences&#10;&#10;### Positive&#10;&#10;- [正面影响 1]&#10;- [正面影响 2]&#10;&#10;### Negative&#10;&#10;- [负面影响 1]&#10;- [负面影响 2]&#10;&#10;### Risks &amp; Mitigations&#10;&#10;- [风险 1]: 缓解措施 [方案]&#10;- [风险 2]: 缓解措施 [方案]&#10;&#10;## Implementation Notes&#10;&#10;[简要的实施指引，不需要详细设计]&#10;&#10;## References&#10;&#10;- [相关文档、RFC、外部资源链接]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR-[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">NNN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">决策标题</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 字段             | 内容                                                     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Status**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       | Proposed / Accepted / Deprecated / Superseded by ADR-NNN |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Date**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         | YYYY-MM-DD                                               |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#2429