ass=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [负面影响 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [负面影响 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Risks &#x26; Mitigations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [风险 1]: 缓解措施 [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">方案</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [风险 2]: 缓解措施 [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">方案</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Implementation Notes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">简要的实施指引，不需要详细设计</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## References</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">相关文档、RFC、外部资源链接</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模板演进策略\">模板演进策略</h3><p>模板不是一成不变的。推荐以下演进路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Week 1-4: Nygard Classic] --&gt; B[Month 2-3: Add Decision Drivers]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Month 4-6: Add Comparison Matrix]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Month 6+: Full Enterprise Template]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Continuous: Remove unused fields]\">graph LR\n    A[Week 1-4: Nygard Classic] --&gt; B[Month 2-3: Add Decision Drivers]\n    B --&gt; C[Month 4-6: Add Comparison Matrix]\n    C --&gt; D[Month 6+: Full Enterprise Template]\n    D --&gt; E[Continuous: Remove unused fields]</pre><p>关键原则是<strong>从最小化开始，按需添加字段</strong>。只有当团队持续感到某个信息缺失时，才增加新的模板字段。避免一开始就使用完整模板导致的写作疲劳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"模板中的写作技巧\">模板中的写作技巧</h3><p><strong>Context 部分的写法</strong>：不要写成需求文档。聚焦于解释「为什么现在需要做这个决策」。好的 Context 回答三个问题：发生了什么变化？面临什么问题？如果不做决策会怎样？</p>\n<p><strong>Decision 部分的写法</strong>：使用祈使语气和现在时态。「We will use PostgreSQL as the primary database」而非「After careful consideration, the team has decided that PostgreSQL would be the best choice.」前者清晰直接，后者冗长模糊。</p>\n<p><strong>Consequences 部分的写法</strong>：区分「必然后果」和「可能风险」。必然后果是决策的直接结果（如选择 NoSQL 就意味着放弃强一致性），可能风险是不确定的未来影响（如该技术可能在三年后停止维护）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见模板反模式\">常见模板反模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>改进</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>万能模板</td>\n<td>20+ 字段，每次都需填写</td>\n<td>核心字段 + 可选字段分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>论文模板</td>\n<td>要求 5000+ 字详细论述</td>\n<td>限制为 1-2 页，详细内容链接到设计文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批流模板</td>\n<td>需要 5 级审批签名</td>\n<td>简化为 1-2 个决策人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯文字模板</td>\n<td>缺乏结构化对比信息</td>\n<td>添加对比矩阵表格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事后模板</td>\n<td>缺少「何时重新评估」字段</td>\n<td>添加 Revisit Trigger</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"模板管理工具\">模板管理工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>模板支持</th>\n<th>集成</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>adr-tools (npryce)</td>\n<td>CLI 工具</td>\n<td>Nygard 模板</td>\n<td>Git, Terminal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log4brains</td>\n<td>Web UI + CLI</td>\n<td>可自定义</td>\n<td>Git, GitHub Pages</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MADR (adr/madr)</td>\n<td>模板仓库</td>\n<td>MADR 4.0</td>\n<td>Any Markdown tool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADR Manager (VS Code)</td>\n<td>IDE 插件</td>\n<td>多模板支持</td>\n<td>VS Code</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Structurizr</td>\n<td>架构平台</td>\n<td>内置 ADR</td>\n<td>C4 Model, DSL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"在项目中初始化-adr-模板\">在项目中初始化 ADR 模板</h3><p>使用 <code>adr-tools</code> 的典型初始化流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 adr-tools&#10;brew install adr-tools&#10;&#10;# 在项目中初始化 ADR 目录&#10;adr init doc/architecture/decisions&#10;&#10;# 创建自定义模板&#10;cat &gt; doc/architecture/decisions/template.md &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;# NUMBER. TITLE&#10;&#10;Date: DATE&#10;&#10;## Status&#10;&#10;STATUS&#10;&#10;## Context&#10;&#10;[What is the issue we&#39;re addressing?]&#10;&#10;## Decision&#10;&#10;[What have we decided to do?]&#10;&#10;## Consequences&#10;&#10;[What becomes easier or more difficult?]&#10;EOF&#10;&#10;# 创建第一个 ADR&#10;adr new &quot;Use PostgreSQL for primary database&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 adr-tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> adr-tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在项目中初始化 ADR 目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">adr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> doc/architecture/decisions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建自定义模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> doc/architecture/decisions/template.md</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"># NUMBER. TITLE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Date: DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">STATUS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[What is the issue we're addressing?]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[What have we decided to do?]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Consequences</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[What becomes easier or more difficult?]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建第一个 ADR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">adr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Use PostgreSQL for primary database\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>模板设计的黄金法则是：<strong>足够结构化以确保关键信息不被遗漏，又足够简洁以避免成为团队的写作负担</strong>。从 Nygard 经典模板开始，在实践中根据团队的具体需求逐步演进。记住，最好的模板不是最全面的那个，而是团队实际愿意使用的那个。一份被认真填写的简单模板，永远好于一份被敷衍应付的复杂模板。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ADR 模板设计与最佳实践","id":"adr-模板设计与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Nygard 经典模板","id":"nygard-经典模板"},{"level":3,"text":"MADR（Markdown Architectural Decision Records）","id":"madr-markdown-architectural-decision-records"},{"level":3,"text":"Y-Statement 模板","id":"y-statement-模板"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"模板选择决策矩阵","id":"模板选择决策矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"企业级定制模板设计","id":"企业级定制模板设计"},{"level":3,"text":"模板演进策略","id":"模板演进策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"模板中的写作技巧","id":"模板中的写作技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"常见模板反模式","id":"常见模板反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"模板管理工具","id":"模板管理工具"},{"level":3,"text":"在项目中初始化 ADR 模板","id":"在项目中初始化-adr-模板"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"决策记录的价值与原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-value-and-principles"},"next":{"title":"ADR 生命周期与工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-lifecycle-and-toolchain"}}